{"id":71133,"date":"2026-10-28T07:41:45","date_gmt":"2026-10-28T07:41:45","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71133"},"modified":"2026-10-28T08:47:15","modified_gmt":"2026-10-28T07:47:15","slug":"meia-maratona-de-haia","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-de-haia\/","title":{"rendered":"Meia Maratona de Haia 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Meia Maratona de Haia 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Meia Maratona de Haia 2027<\/strong> (51\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da hist\u00f3rica <strong>NN CPC Loop Den Haag<\/strong> \u2013 <em>City-Pier-City Run<\/em>) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>14 de mar\u00e7o de 2027<\/strong>, com partidas e chegadas centradas no <strong>Malieveld \/ Koningskade<\/strong>, em <strong>Haia, Pa\u00edses Baixos<\/strong>. Internacionalmente reconhecida pelo seu tra\u00e7ado ultrarr\u00e1pido entre o centro da cidade e o pared\u00e3o mar\u00edtimo de Scheveningen, a prova j\u00e1 foi palco de recordes mundiais e nacionais neerlandeses.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Al\u00e9m da prova rainha de <strong>Meia Maratona (21,1 km)<\/strong>, que parte \u00e0s <strong>11h00<\/strong> em 6 vagas, o programa de domingo integra a <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s 15h20 em 4 vagas), a <strong>Corrida de 5 km<\/strong> (10h00 em 2 vagas), provas jovens (<strong>2,5 km<\/strong> \u00e0s 08h30 e <strong>1 km<\/strong> \u00e0s 09h15) e a prova inclusiva <strong>NN CPC4ALL (1 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s 09h45. Na sexta-feira, 12 de mar\u00e7o, realiza-se ainda a caminhada noturna <strong>City Pier Night Walk<\/strong> (4 km, 7 km e 12 km).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela <strong>Stichting Nederland Beweegt<\/strong>, a 51\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o associa-se \u00e0 causa solid\u00e1ria da <em>KWF (Dutch Cancer Society)<\/em> e apresenta uma t-shirt t\u00e9cnica de edi\u00e7\u00e3o limitada da Brooks inspirada no museu Mauritshuis. O levantamento obrigat\u00f3rio de dorsais individuais decorre na tenda oficial no <strong>Malieveld<\/strong> (acesso via Koekamplaan) entre sexta-feira (12 de mar\u00e7o) e domingo (14 de mar\u00e7o). Explora tamb\u00e9m o calend\u00e1rio das melhores <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/meia-maratona\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Meias Maratonas em Portugal<\/a> e prepara a tua prova na <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Ritmo (Pace)<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">14 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Malieveld \/ Koningskade, Haia, Pa\u00edses Baixos<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">21,1 km \/ 10 km \/ 5 km<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Stichting Nederland Beweegt (NN CPC Loop Den Haag)<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">17h40 (Encerramento da Meta)<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tipo de Piso<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Asfalto \/ Estrada Urbana<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Perfil & Relevo<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Plano e R\u00e1pido<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/nncpcloopdenhaag.nl\/en\/event-info\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\">\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Consultar Regulamento Oficial &rarr;\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li><div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas & Sub-eventos<\/strong><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Meia Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">NN Half Marathon (Meia Maratona 21,1 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 14 de mar\u00e7o de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 11:00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Tarifa 1 (Primeiros 1.500 inscritos):<\/strong> 44,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Tarifa 2 (1.501 a 3.000 inscritos):<\/strong> 46,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Tarifa 3 (3.001 at\u00e9 esgotar):<\/strong> 49,50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida 10 km<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">10 KM Run<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 14 de mar\u00e7o de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 15:20<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Tarifa 1 (1 a 1.000 inscritos):<\/strong> 31,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Tarifa 2 (1.001 a 3.000 inscritos):<\/strong> 34,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Tarifa 3 (3.001 at\u00e9 esgotar):<\/strong> 36,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">5 KM Run<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 14 de mar\u00e7o de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Tarifa 1 (1 a 1.000 inscritos):<\/strong> 23,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Tarifa 2 (A partir de 1.001 at\u00e9 esgotar):<\/strong> 26,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Jovem \/ Inclusiva<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">gro-up Jeugdloop 2,5 km \/ 1 km & NN CPC4ALL<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 14 de mar\u00e7o de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:30<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a Meia Maratona de Haia 2027 (NN CPC Loop Den Haag)?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 51\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da NN CPC Loop Den Haag realiza-se no domingo, 14 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, com partida na Koningskade e centro log\u00edstico e meta no Malieveld, em Haia, nos Pa\u00edses Baixos.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida das diferentes dist\u00e2ncias?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No domingo, 14 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, o programa arranca \u00e0s 08h30 com a Jeugdloop 2,5 km, seguida da Jeugdloop 1 km (09h15), NN CPC4ALL 1 km (09h45) e 5 km Run (10h00 e 10h15). A Meia Maratona (21,1 km) parte em 6 vagas entre as 11h00 e as 12h15, e a corrida de 10 km parte em 4 vagas entre as 15h20 e as 16h05.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quanto custa a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na Meia Maratona, 10 km e 5 km?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na Meia Maratona (21,1 km), as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es custam 44,00 \u20ac (primeiros 1.500), 46,00 \u20ac (1.501 a 3.000) e 49,50 \u20ac (a partir de 3.001). Nos 10 km os valores s\u00e3o de 31,00 \u20ac, 34,00 \u20ac e 36,00 \u20ac, e nos 5 km s\u00e3o de 23,00 \u20ac (primeiros 1.000) e 26,00 \u20ac.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e como obter dorsal personalizado?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal oficial com cronometragem MyLaps, medalha de finalista, abastecimentos no percurso e na meta e acesso a balne\u00e1rios. Os atletas que se inscrevam at\u00e9 31 de janeiro de 2027 recebem o dorsal personalizado com o primeiro nome e t\u00eam a sua vaga de partida atribu\u00edda segundo o tempo previsto.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e em que hor\u00e1rios posso levantar o dorsal?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os dorsais individuais n\u00e3o s\u00e3o enviados por correio e t\u00eam de ser levantados no Malieveld (acesso pela Koekamplaan, em Haia) na sexta-feira, 12 de mar\u00e7o (12h00\u201319h00), no s\u00e1bado, 13 de mar\u00e7o (12h00\u201317h00), ou no pr\u00f3prio domingo, 14 de mar\u00e7o (07h30\u201315h30).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o percurso City-Pier-City em Haia?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O percurso da Meia Maratona liga o centro hist\u00f3rico de Haia \u00e0 costa do Mar do Norte: parte da Koningskade (junto ao Malieveld), atravessa os bairros da cidade e os bosques em dire\u00e7\u00e3o ao pared\u00e3o mar\u00edtimo de Scheveningen (Pier) e regressa para cortar a meta no Malieveld.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Meia Maratona de Haia 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-03-14\", \"endDate\": \"2027-03-14\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Malieveld \/ Koningskade, Haia, Pa\u00edses Baixos\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Haia\", \"addressRegion\": \"Pa\u00edses Baixos\", \"addressCountry\": \"NL\"}}, \"description\": \"A Meia Maratona de Haia 2027 (NN CPC Loop Den Haag) realiza-se a 14 de mar\u00e7o nos Pa\u00edses Baixos. Provas de 21,1 km, 10 km e 5 km. Consulta j\u00e1 o guia oficial!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-meia-maratona-de-haia.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"NN Half Marathon (Meia Maratona 21,1 km)\", \"price\": \"44.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/nncpcloopdenhaag.nl\/en\/register\/nn-half-marathon\/\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"10 KM Run\", \"price\": \"31.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/nncpcloopdenhaag.nl\/en\/register\/nn-half-marathon\/\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"5 KM Run\", \"price\": \"23.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR